    url: 'using-structured-fields.html#structured-condition-regex',
    text: ' Matches regex searches within the selected value. It does not need to match the whole value, and it is case-sensitive by default. A pattern such as ^(?:gills|systemd)$ on fields → process.name matches those unit names exactly.  Enter the pattern without surrounding slashes. A missing field or a non-scalar value does not match a regex condition. Patterns follow KEEN’s shared rules: a 512-character limit, restricted constructions and bounded execution. The editor rejects a pattern that would run the matcher for too long; simplify it and try again. ',
