    url: 'using-security-monitoring.html#keen-with-siems',
    text: ' If you run Wazuh or another SIEM, KEEN does not replace it. This chapter explains how the two divide the work, how to bring security events into KEEN, and what a reviewed piece of security evidence looks like end to end. ',
