    url: 'administrator-deployment.html#3-configure-the-runtime',
    text: ' The definitive list of settings is services/api/app/core/config.py . Most fields use the KEEN_ prefix; some connector secrets have explicit aliases. Apply the same relevant settings to API, worker and beat, and recreate a container after changing its environment: editing .env on the host changes nothing in a running container.  The Administration overview: workspace, access and system panes in the sidebar, and quick links to the common jobs. ',
