    url: 'administrator-identity.html#mfa-operator-recovery',
    text: ' Verify the account owner’s identity through your organisation’s recovery process first. Then an operator with access to the API container and database can reset local factors:  docker compose exec keen-api python scripts/mfa_admin.py alice --reset --confirm-username alice  This removes authenticators, recovery codes and pending challenges, revokes local sessions and records an operator-reset audit entry. It keeps the password, and a required account enrols again at its next login. A password reset on its own leaves MFA enrolment in place. Restrict shell and database access accordingly. ',
