    text: ' Agent heartbeats report delivery counters, queue size and source health. Review these in the agent inventory to identify collection failures or delivery backlogs, and use the agent’s local status and service logs to investigate a reported problem.  Journal records include available service.name , process.name , process.pid , user.id , group.id , host.name and log.syslog.priority ; original metadata remains and is redacted before queuing. Known agent failures, cron command starts and SSH authentication results receive specific actions, and unrecognised messages remain syslog.record . Inspect an event’s structured fields when choosing mapping conditions. ',
